{"id":"b22231033a","t":"Pandora Hearts","c":"cv","n":50,"l":104,"s":["aq"],"k":{"aq":"pandora-hearts"},"u":1795035908480,"desc":"تتحوّل أجواء الاحتفال التي تُحيط بمراسم بلوغ أوز فيزاليوس ذي ال15 ربيعًا سريعًا إلى حدث رُعب حين يُدان بخطئية لا يعرف عنها شيئًا. يُزج في سجن أبديّ لا مهرب منه يدعى الهاوية. يلتقي فيه فتاةً منظرها لا يعكس شخصيتها، تدعى أليس. تبدأُ تروس القدر حركتها بلا رحمة، ألا يُشيرون لشيء غير اليأس المطلق لأوز، أم أنّ بصيص الأمل سيمتدُّ اليه؟","type":"مانجا","status":"مكتملة","genres":["100%","دراما","شونين","غموض","قوى خارقة"],"src":{"aq":"pandora-hearts"},"chapters":{"32":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/32/"},"56":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/56/"},"57":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/57/"},"58":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/58/"},"59":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/59/"},"60":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/60/"},"61":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/61/"},"62":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/62/"},"63":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/63/"},"64":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/64/"},"65":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/65/"},"66":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/66/"},"67":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/67/"},"68":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/68/"},"69":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/69/"},"70":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/70/"},"71":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/71/"},"72":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/72/"},"73":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/73/"},"74":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/74/"},"75":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/75/"},"76":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/76/"},"77":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/77/"},"78":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/78/"},"79":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pandora-hearts/79/"},"80":{"aq":"pandora-hearts|/manga/pa